; DNS records for davidlevine.dev, ready for Cloudflare's DNS -> Records -> Import.
; When importing, leave "Proxy imported DNS records" UNCHECKED: every record must be DNS only (grey cloud).
; TTL 1 means "Auto" in Cloudflare.

; Google ownership verification (Search Console). Google keeps re-checking it, so never delete it.
davidlevine.dev.          1  IN  TXT    "google-site-verification=sgUnObWHih8SfXHdVoWBBa6Gscxex8M2pPUHBG0xqMQ"

